&lt;p&gt;We are currently seeking&lt;strong&gt; Data Privacy Lawyers &lt;/strong&gt;and certified privacy professionals to work with a variety of Axiom clients across industries, supporting one of the largest privacy teams in the UK on flexible in-house engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
